


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_f64a2b55:



    voice "2AR_0002"
    arthur "「汪！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_9fc6677f:


    "和中意的两个人一起散步，亚瑟心情大好。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_5db7a053:


    "冬季高远澄澈的天空之下，伦在公园的散步道上走着。右手牵着亚瑟的绳子，左手牵着阳菜的手。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_76ed458f:


    "虽然是被两只（？）强有力的家伙给牵着跑，但她的表情还是很开心的。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_0bd7e8ba:



    voice "2AR_0001"
    arthur "「汪！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_8b424da2:



    voice "2RI_1536"
    rin "「等等。不是那边，亚瑟」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_5b65f620:


    "亚瑟瞅见其他的狗打算冲上去，而伦牵紧了狗绳加以制止。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_cafa9d41:



    voice "2HI_1541"
    hina "「以前总是一惊一乍的，现在从容许多了嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_97479fba:



    voice "2RI_1537"
    rin "「毕竟每天都在照顾阳菜啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_d1bffaf9:


    "重要的是传达爱情以及保持自信进行接触。对阳菜也是同理。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_84c28449:



    voice "2HI_1542"
    hina "「啊，有喷泉。我去拍照」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_156d1d87:



    voice "2RI_1538"
    rin "「啊，阳菜！你要跑的话先松手——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_0bd7e8ba_1:



    voice "2AR_0001"
    arthur "「汪！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_2c8ff183:



    voice "2RI_1539"
    rin "「哇哇哇！连亚瑟也跑了！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_72d5bb30:


    "在阳菜的带头作用下，亚瑟也跟着跑了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_cf85284b:



    voice "2RI_1540"
    rin "「喂喂喂喂！你们别往不同方向跑啊！我手腕会散架的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_593b7d88:



    voice "2HI_1543"
    hina "「赛跑了赛跑了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_5224a1b2:



    voice "2RI_1541"
    rin "「阳菜等等！我让你等等！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_2c0c3ace:



    voice "2HI_1544"
    hina "「好——♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_0f28468a:



    voice "2RI_1542"
    rin "「你光嘴上答应有啥用啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_12_2a054e45:


    "看来伦要成为合格的主人还有很长的路要走啊。"
